"P981910796" "Neighborhood of Niceguys developer says..."
// DetailString :
"P767065453" "As you take the developer away from the Malta captors, he says:<br><br>'I'm afraid we've already done some work on <i>Malta Online</i> which needs to be taken care of. If you don't destroy our workstations, our secret development techniques will be secrets no longer... and we'd lose our competitive advantage.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P273619499" "I'll never get my work done on this game if the rest of my team doesn't get here soon.<br><br><color YellowGreen><i>Brrrrring... Brrrrring...</i></color><br><br>That's my oh-so-charming retro text message tone. Hold on a sec... Oh noes! The rest of my team was abducted by the shadowy Malta Group. They've been working on a competing product: <i>Malta Online</i>, and I guess they decided to... recruit my team. You've got to rescue them or I'm going to have to do all the work myself!"
// AcceptString :
"P3975072917" "Rescue the devs from the Malta Group"
// SendOffString :
"P499901293" "They've probably been taken to a facility as slave labor for Malta Online. Makes me cringe just thinking about it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3037191769" "Rescue the NoN devs"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P636575927" "Why haven't you rescued my team yet?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2259315530" "<color deepskyblue>The Malevolent Malta Machinations</color>"

